# NewUnera — Checkbox row (`.checkbox-label`)

For visible checkboxes in `NewUnera/` forms and modals, **do not** use a bare `<input type="checkbox">` with a sibling `.form-label` outside a wrapper (legacy `.form-check-row`).

## Forbidden

```html
<!-- ❌ -->
<div class="form-check-row">
  <input type="checkbox" id="x">
  <label class="form-label" for="x">Label</label>
</div>
```

Exception: screen-reader-only checkboxes documented in the implementing page (rare); still prefer `.checkbox-label` when the control is user-visible.

## Required structure

```html
<div class="checkbox-group" role="group" aria-labelledby="groupLabelId">
  <span class="form-label" id="groupLabelId">Section title</span>
  <label class="checkbox-label" for="fieldId">
    <input type="checkbox" id="fieldId" aria-describedby="optionalHintId">
    <span>Visible label text</span>
  </label>
</div>
<p class="form-hint" id="optionalHintId">Optional hint below the group.</p>
```

## Sizing and tokens

| Element | Spec |
|--------|------|
| `input[type="checkbox"]` | `20×20px`, `accent-color: var(--brand-deep-blue)` |
| `.checkbox-label` | `min-height: 48px`, `padding: 0.875rem 1rem`, `border: 2px solid var(--border-subtle)`, `border-radius: 0.75rem` |
| Hover | `border-color: var(--brand-deep-blue)`; light tint via `color-mix` with brand tokens |
| Checked label text | `font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-deep-blue)` on `input:checked + span` |
| Focus | `outline: 3px solid var(--brand-deep-blue); outline-offset: 2px` on `:focus-visible` |

