## Accessibility

- Group: `role="group"` + `aria-labelledby` on section title
- Checkbox: `for` / `id` pairing; use `aria-describedby` for hints
- Touch target: entire `.checkbox-label` row is clickable (≥48px height)
- Do not remove focus ring for keyboard users

